<%doc>

=head1 NAME 
qtl/population/data_access.mas - a component for displaying a note for private qtl data.

=AUTHOR
Isaak Y Tecle (iyt2@cornell.edu)

=cut

</%doc>

<%args>

$pop
$owner_page

</%args>


<&| /page/info_section.mas, 
  collapsible => 1, 
  collapsed   => 0, 
  title       => "資料存取(Data access)" 
&>   
  <p>
    此群體的 QTL 資料尚未公開。如果您是資料擁有者或 SGN 管理員，請登入以存取資料。其他人若想了解有關此資料的更多資訊，可以聯繫資料擁有者(The QTL data for this population is not public yet. If you are the data owner or SGN curator, login to access the data. Others who would like to know more about the data can contact the owner of the data)：<b><% $owner_page %></b> 或 SGN(or SGN)：<a href=mailto:sgn-feedback@sgn.cornell.edu>
    sgn-feedback@sgn.cornell.edu</a>。
  </p>
</&>


 


